=== Glass Unit ===
id: services.streaks
version: 0.1.0
language: typescript

=== Intent ===
purpose: Compute streak data for habits and journal entries. Provides current streak (consecutive completions), consecutive misses, and totals by analyzing habit logs and entry dates in reverse chronological order.
source:
  kind: prd
  reference: "Bot Personality & Streak-Aware Responses — Streak Computation"
parent: index
stakeholder: system
subIntents: []
approvalStatus: approved

=== Contract ===
requires:
  - "Habit logs exist in D1 ordered by log_date DESC"
  - "Journal entries exist in D1 with entry_date field"
guarantees:
  on_success:
    - "getHabitStreak returns currentStreak, consecutiveMisses, totalCompletions, totalDays"
    - "currentStreak counts consecutive completed=1 days from most recent backwards"
    - "consecutiveMisses counts consecutive completed=0 days from most recent backwards"
    - "Only one of currentStreak or consecutiveMisses is non-zero at any time"
    - "getJournalStreak returns currentStreak and daysSinceLastEntry"
    - "Journal streak counts consecutive days with at least one non-digest entry"
    - "daysSinceLastEntry is 0 if an entry exists for asOfDate"
  on_failure:
    - "Returns zeroed data if no logs or entries exist"
invariants:
  - "Streak computation is pure — depends only on log data and asOfDate"
  - "Logs analyzed up to 60 days back (configurable limit)"
fails:
  DatabaseError: "Propagate to caller"
